From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Zorzi <alleszorzi@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:27:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Stop setting NAL length-prefixed encoder output

AOSP MPEG4Writer can't find the HEVC parameter sets in a length-prefixed
stream, so 4K and 8K recordings lost their video track.

Ported from myron's 0004; vb/e -> Ki/f.
---
 smali_classes5/Ki/f.smali | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/smali_classes5/Ki/f.smali b/smali_classes5/Ki/f.smali
index 00a841e..9dd340a 100644
--- a/smali_classes5/Ki/f.smali
+++ b/smali_classes5/Ki/f.smali
@@ -780,7 +780,7 @@
 
     iget-boolean v7, v3, LKi/r;->y:Z
 
-    if-eqz v7, :cond_1c
+    goto :cond_1c
 
     iget v7, v3, LKi/r;->l:I
 
